---
import LegalPage from "../layouts/LegalPage.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy · Donegal Airport";
const description = "How Donegal Airport (CFN) collects and uses data through this website.";
---

<LegalPage
  title={title}
  description={description}
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lastUpdated="Draft — pending final review by Donegal Airport Co."
>
  <p>
    This policy covers this website only. Data the airport holds through other channels (phone,
    post, in person, CCTV) is handled separately.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    Donegal Airport Co., Carrickfinn, Kincasslagh, Letterkenny, Co. Donegal, F94 X2RH, Ireland, is
    the data controller for this site. Contact:
    <a href="mailto:info@donegalairport.ie">info@donegalairport.ie</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, and message — collected only if you
    submit it.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Newsletter:</strong> your email address, and your consent to receive marketing emails —
    collected only if you sign up. You'll get a confirmation email before you're added to any list
    (double opt-in); you're not subscribed until you confirm.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Analytics:</strong> if you accept analytics cookies, anonymised usage data — pages
    viewed, general location, device type. Change your choice anytime via "Cookie settings" in the
    footer.
  </p>
  <p>
    No advertising or remarketing trackers. We don't sell data.
  </p>

  <h2>Who processes it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Our contact form service — delivers submissions to our inbox.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Mailchimp</strong> (The Rocket Science Group LLC) — sends and manages the newsletter,
      only for addresses that sign up. Every email includes an unsubscribe link, and unsubscribing
      is immediate. See <a href="https://mailchimp.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mailchimp's own privacy policy</a>.
    </li>
    <li>Our analytics provider — only if you've accepted analytics cookies.</li>
    <li>Our hosting provider — standard server logs (IP, timestamp, page requested).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Some may process data outside the EEA under standard safeguards (EU Standard Contractual
    Clauses).
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Contact form messages: as long as needed to handle your enquiry. Newsletter: until you
    unsubscribe. Analytics: per our provider's standard retention period.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    This site runs entirely over HTTPS. Access to the services above is limited to what each needs
    to do its job.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    This site links to external websites we don't control. Their own privacy policy applies once
    you leave donegalairport.ie.
  </p>

  <h2>If the airport is sold</h2>
  <p>
    If Donegal Airport Co. is sold or merged, your data may be passed to the new owner under the
    same terms as this policy.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under GDPR, you can ask us to access, correct, or delete your data, or object to how it's
    processed. Contact <a href="mailto:info@donegalairport.ie">info@donegalairport.ie</a> — we'll
    get back to you as soon as we can. You can also complain to the
    <a href="https://www.dataprotection.ie" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Data Protection Commission</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this page as the website changes.</p>
</LegalPage>
